{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-10-31 13:44:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022 - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 31, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-10-31 12:00:00', 'title': 'DEADLINE REMINDER: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH REMINDS INVESTORS OF LOOMING DEADLINE IN THE CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP (USB)', 'text': 'BENSALEM, PA.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-10-31 10:00:00', 'title': 'BRONSTEIN, GEWIRTZ & GROSSMAN, LLC, A SUCCESSFUL FIRM, NOTIFIES U.S. BANCORP (USB) INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS TO ACTIVELY PARTICIPATE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ATTORNEY ADVERTISING-- BRONSTEIN, GEWIRTZ & GROSSMAN, LLC NOTIFIES INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST\xa0U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE:\xa0USB)\xa0AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS, ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED, OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED\xa0U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ENCOURAGED TO JOIN THIS CASE BY VISITING THE FIRM\'S SITE: WWW.BGANDG.COM/USB.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-10-31 08:59:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM FILES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP AND ADVISES SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 31, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANK" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-10-29 06:44:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A LEADING LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS WITH LOSSES OVER $100K TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF U.S. BANCORP (NYSE: USB) BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS ALREADY BEEN FILED.'}